#: templates/pages/sections/10_corporate_social_responsibility_section.html:12
msgid "Corporate Social Responsibility"
msgstr "Responsabilidad Social Corporativa"

#: templates/pages/sections/10_corporate_social_responsibility_section.html:17
msgid ""
"We firmly believe in giving back to society and supporting causes that reflect our\n"
"            principles."
msgstr ""
"Creemos firmemente en retribuir a la sociedad y en apoyar causas que "
"reflejan nuestros principios."

#: templates/pages/sections/10_corporate_social_responsibility_section.html:21
msgid ""
"With our own resources, we allocate part of our income to the rescue and protection of\n"
"            animals as sentient beings, convinced of the importance of providing them with care, dignity, and a new\n"
"            chance at life."
msgstr ""
"Con recursos propios destinamos parte de nuestros ingresos al rescate y "
"protección de animales como seres sintientes, convencidos de la importancia "
"de brindarles cuidado, dignidad y una nueva oportunidad de vida."

#: templates/pages/sections/10_corporate_social_responsibility_section.html:26
msgid ""
"Similarly, we develop programs aimed at the elderly, children, and homeless\n"
"            people—populations that deserve special protection and concrete actions that restore hope and well-being.\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"De igual manera, desarrollamos programas orientados al adulto mayor, a la "
"niñez y a las personas habitantes de calle, poblaciones que merecen una "
"protección especial y acciones concretas que les devuelvan esperanza y "
"bienestar."

#: templates/pages/sections/10_corporate_social_responsibility_section.html:31
msgid ""
"For us, this commitment is not only social, but also an obligation to God, who reminds us of\n"
"            the duty to serve, protect, and dignify the most vulnerable."
msgstr ""
"Para nosotros, este compromiso no es solo social, sino también una "
"obligación con Dios, quien nos recuerda el deber de servir, proteger y "
"dignificar a los más vulnerables."

#: templates/pages/sections/10_corporate_social_responsibility_section.html:35
msgid ""
"Each of these initiatives is realized in actions, not promises. Our commitment is fulfilled\n"
"            directly, without intermediaries."
msgstr ""
"Cada una de estas iniciativas se materializa en hechos, no en promesas. "
"Nuestro compromiso se cumple directamente, sin intermediarios."

