#: templates/pages/sections/2_principles_section.html:15
msgid "Justice"
msgstr "Justicia"

#: templates/pages/sections/2_principles_section.html:18
msgid ""
" We act with fairness and impartiality, ensuring\n"
"            that everyone is treated equally and their rights are respected.\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"Obramos con equidad e imparcialidad, garantizando que todas las personas "
"reciban un trato justo y que se respeten sus derechos."

#: templates/pages/sections/2_principles_section.html:30
msgid "Integrity"
msgstr "Integridad"

#: templates/pages/sections/2_principles_section.html:33
msgid ""
" We are consistent in our actions and beliefs,\n"
"            always guided by the values of faith in God. "
msgstr ""
"Somos coherentes entre lo que profesamos y actuamos, siempre bajo los "
"valores de la fe en Dios."

#: templates/pages/sections/2_principles_section.html:44
msgid "Dedication"
msgstr "Entrega"

#: templates/pages/sections/2_principles_section.html:47
msgid ""
" We are deeply committed to defending our clients'\n"
"            rights with passion and determination, striving to achieve goals and\n"
"            honor our commitments. "
msgstr ""
"Máximo compromiso para defender los derechos de nuestros clientes, con "
"pasión y determinación, para alcanzar objetivos y cumplir con nuestros "
"compromisos."

#: templates/pages/sections/3_CEO_jorge.html:33
msgid "C.E.O Jorge Uriel Vega Londoño"
msgstr "C.E.O Jorge Uriel Vega Londoño"

#: templates/pages/sections/4_social_sense.html:10
msgid "Why Was Our Law Firm Born With A Social Sense?"
msgstr "¿Por Qué Nace Nuestra Firma Con Un Sentido Social?"

#: templates/pages/sections/4_social_sense.html:17
msgid ""
" PROPENSIONES LAWYERS arose from my mother's tireless\n"
"          fight to obtain her pension, after being denied it seven times over 17\n"
"          years. After much research, perseverance and dedication, we managed to\n"
"          secure your pension rights. "
msgstr ""
"PROPENSIONES ABOGADOS surgió de la lucha incansable de mi madre para obtener"
" su pensión, tras serle negada en siete ocasiones durante 17 años. Después "
"de mucha investigación,  perseverancia y dedicación, logramos asegurar su "
"derecho pensional. "

#: templates/pages/sections/4_social_sense.html:24
msgid ""
"Inspired by the joy and well-being that this brought to\n"
"          my mother, we opened the DENIED PENSIONS service with a strong social\n"
"          commitment, focused on helping others obtain and enjoy their pension\n"
"          rights, thus improving their quality of life."
msgstr ""
"Inspirado por la alegría y bienestar que esto le trajo a mi madre, abrimos "
"el servicio de PENSIONES NEGADAS con un fuerte compromiso social, enfocado "
"en ayudar a otros a obtener y disfrutar de sus derechos pensionales, "
"mejorando así su calidad de vida."

#: templates/pages/sections/4_social_sense.html:33
msgid ""
" Today, thanks to GOD and personal effort, she enjoys\n"
"          her pension. From the moment I saw THE HAPPINESS that obtaining pension\n"
"          rights brings to a person, I started PROPENSIONES ABOGADOS as a line of\n"
"          business with a social objective focused on improving people's quality\n"
"          of life through obtaining and enjoying your pension right.\n"
"          "
msgstr ""
"Hoy, gracias a DIOS y al esfuerzo personal, ella disfruta de su pensión. "
"Desde el mismo instante en que vi LA FELICIDAD que le genera a una persona "
"obtener el derecho pensional, inicié PROPENSIONES ABOGADOS como una línea de"
" negocio con un objetivo social centrado en mejorar la calidad de vida de "
"las personas a través de la obtención y disfrute de su derecho pensional."

#: templates/pages/sections/4_social_sense.html:42
msgid ""
" Thanks to our rigorous work, little by little we have\n"
"          achieved great successes that have allowed us to internationalize to\n"
"          cover the corporate needs of our clients. "
msgstr ""
"Gracias a nuestro riguroso trabajo, poco a poco hemos conseguido grandes "
"éxitos que nos han permitido internacionalizarnos para cubrir las "
"necesidades corporativas de nuestros clientes."

#: templates/pages/sections/6_about_section.html:7
msgid "PROPENSIONES LAWYERS S.A.S"
msgstr "PROPENSIONES ABOGADOS S.A.S"

#: templates/pages/sections/6_about_section.html:10
msgid ""
" Propensiones Abogados is a legally constituted law\n"
"          firm that combines legal expertise with human quality to guarantee\n"
"          comprehensive legal and legal advice to national and international\n"
"          clients. "
msgstr ""
"Propensiones Abogados es una firma legalmente constituido\n"
" que combina experticia jurídica con calidad humana para garantizar\n"
" una asesoría integral, legal y jurídica, a clientes nacionales e internacionales."

#: templates/pages/sections/6_about_section.html:17
msgid ""
" We are proud to be a team of professionals committed\n"
"          to improving the quality of life of our clients through obtaining and\n"
"          enjoying their rights. "
msgstr ""
"Nos enorgullece ser un equipo de profesionales comprometidos con mejorar la "
"calidad de vida de nuestros clientes a través de la obtención y  disfrute de"
" sus derechos pensionales."

#: templates/pages/sections/6_about_section.html:30
msgid "Experience"
msgstr "Experiencia"

#: templates/pages/sections/6_about_section.html:32
msgid ""
" In Colombia, we specialize in Denied Pensions, Economic Insolvency,\n"
"                Extracontractual Liability, Emergency Conciliations, Business\n"
"                Consulting and Field Investigation, Civil Law, Criminal Law,\n"
"                Family Law and Labor Law. "
msgstr ""
"En Colombia, nos especializamos en Pensiones Negadas, Insolvencia Económica,"
" Responsabilidad Extracontractual, Conciliaciones de Emergencia, Asesoría "
"Empresarial e Investigación de Campo, Derecho Civil, Derecho Penal, Derecho "
"de Familia y Derecho Laboral."

#: templates/pages/sections/6_about_section.html:45
msgid "International"
msgstr "Internacional"

#: templates/pages/sections/6_about_section.html:47
msgid ""
" At International Law we offer emergency\n"
"                conciliation services, risk analysis, commercial law, historical\n"
"                asset management and Paymaster. "
msgstr ""
"En Derecho Internacional ofrecemos los servicios de conciliaciones de "
"emergencia, análisis de riesgo, derecho comercial, gestión de activos "
"históricos y Paymaster."

#: templates/pages/sections/7_all_team_section.html:5
msgid "Expertise In Each Area And Human Quality."
msgstr "Experiencia Jurídica con Calidad Humana"

#: templates/pages/sections/7_all_team_section.html:6
msgid "Executive Team"
msgstr "Grupo Ejecutivo "

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:7
#: templates/partials/footer.html:50 templates/partials/header.html:42
msgid "Services"
msgstr "Servicios"

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:10
msgid ""
"Propensiones Internacional acts as advisory agent and accredited "
"representative in Colombia for a group of foreign investors."
msgstr ""
"Propensiones Internacional actúa como agente asesor y representante "
"acreditado en Colombia para un grupo de inversionistas extranjeros."

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:14
msgid ""
"Legal services nationwide in Armenia, Bogota, Buenaventura, Buga, Cali, "
"Cartago, Cucuta, Ibague, Medellin, Quimbaya y Tulua."
msgstr ""
"Servicios legales a nivel nacional en Armenia, Bogotá, Buenaventura, Buga, "
"Cali, Cartago, Cúcuta, Ibagué, Medellín, Quimbaya y Tuluá."

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:18
msgid ""
"Our firm provides a comprehensive range of specialized legal and financial "
"services to address challenges effectively and deliver lasting solutions. We"
" offer expert support at both national and international levels, ensuring "
"your interests are protected and optimized."
msgstr ""
"Nuestra firma ofrece una gama integral de servicios legales y financieros "
"especializados para abordar desafíos de manera efectiva y brindar soluciones"
" duraderas. Brindamos apoyo experto tanto a nivel nacional como "
"internacional, asegurando que sus intereses estén protegidos y optimizados."

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:23
msgid "National Services:"
msgstr "Servicios Nacionales:"

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:25
msgid ""
"Solutions tailored to individuals and businesses in Colombia, including "
"pensions, economic insolvency, civil and criminal law, family matters, labor"
" disputes, and urgent conciliations. We focus on delivering justice, "
"financial stability, and peace of mind."
msgstr ""
"Soluciones adaptadas a individuos y empresas en Colombia, que incluyen "
"pensiones, insolvencia económica, derecho civil y penal, asuntos familiares,"
" disputas laborales y conciliaciones urgentes. Nos enfocamos en brindar "
"justicia, estabilidad financiera y tranquilidad."

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:29
msgid "International Services:"
msgstr "Servicios Internacionales:"

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:31
msgid ""
"Specialized support for global operations, including asset management, risk "
"analysis, paymaster services, commercial law, and emergency conciliations. "
"We provide secure, transparent, and effective solutions for cross-border "
"challenges."
msgstr ""
"Soporte especializado para operaciones globales, que incluye gestión de "
"activos, análisis de riesgos, servicios de pago, derecho comercial y "
"conciliaciones urgentes. Ofrecemos soluciones seguras, transparentes y "
"efectivas para desafíos transfronterizos."

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:35
msgid "Purchase, Sale and Export of Gold and Precious Metals:"
msgstr "Compra, Venta y Exportación de Oro y Metales Preciosos:"

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:37
msgid ""
"We are a company legally registered in the Single Registry of Mineral "
"Traders (RUCOM) administered by the National Mining Agency, which enables us"
" to buy, sell, broker and export minerals."
msgstr ""
"Somos una compañía legalmente inscrita en el Registro Único de "
"Comercializadores de Minerales (RUCOM) administrado por la Agencia Nacional "
"de Minería, lo que nos habilita para la compra, venta, intermediación y "
"exportación de minerales."

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:40
msgid ""
"We participate in the marketing of gold, silver, diamonds and emeralds, "
"under standards of legality, traceability and regulatory compliance, "
"orienting our operations towards international markets, especially the "
"United States and Europe."
msgstr ""
"Participamos en la comercialización de oro, plata, diamantes y esmeraldas, "
"bajo estándares de legalidad, trazabilidad y cumplimiento regulatorio, "
"orientando nuestras operaciones hacia mercados internacionales, "
"especialmente Estados Unidos y Europa."

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:46
msgid ""
"Each service can be contracted individually, specifically adapted to meet "
"your needs and objectives with precision and excellence."
msgstr ""
"Cada servicio puede contratarse de forma individual, adaptado "
"específicamente para satisfacer sus necesidades y objetivos con precisión y "
"excelencia."

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:63
#: templates/partials/footer.html:19
msgid "Economic Insolvency"
msgstr "Insolvencia Económica"

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:65
msgid ""
"Our firm offers specialized services for handling cases of economic "
"insolvency for both non-commercial individuals and commercial entities. We "
"guide clients through restructuring their debts, negotiating with creditors,"
" and ensuring compliance with legal requirements to achieve financial "
"stability."
msgstr ""
"Nuestra firma ofrece servicios especializados para el manejo de casos de "
"insolvencia económica tanto para personas no comerciantes como para "
"entidades comerciales. Guiamos a los clientes en la reestructuración de sus "
"deudas, la negociación con acreedores y el cumplimiento de los requisitos "
"legales para lograr la estabilidad financiera."

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:77
#: templates/partials/footer.html:15
msgid "Denied Pensions"
msgstr "Pensiones negadas"

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:79
msgid ""
"We specialize in representing clients in cases of denied pensions, ensuring "
"they receive the benefits they are entitled to."
msgstr ""
"Nos especializamos en representar a clientes en casos de pensiones negadas, "
"asegurando que reciban los beneficios a los que tienen derecho."

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:91
msgid "Extracontractual Liability"
msgstr "Responsabilidad Extracontractual"

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:93
msgid ""
"We offer expertise in cases of extracontractual liability, protecting "
"clients from unjust claims and ensuring justice."
msgstr ""
"Ofrecemos experiencia en casos de responsabilidad extracontractual, "
"protegiendo a los clientes con reclamaciones justas y garantizando la "
"justicia."

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:105
#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:221
msgid "Emergency Conciliations"
msgstr "Conciliaciones de Emergencia"

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:107
msgid ""
"Specialized services to handle urgent conciliations in national disputes, "
"ensuring quick and effective resolutions."
msgstr ""
"Servicios especializados para manejar conciliaciones urgentes en disputas "
"nacionales, asegurando resoluciones rápidas y efectivas."

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:119
msgid "Business Consultancy"
msgstr "Consultoría Empresarial"

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:121
msgid ""
"We provide expert business consultancy, helping businesses streamline "
"operations and maximize efficiency."
msgstr ""
"Brindamos consultoría empresarial experta, ayudando a las empresas a "
"optimizar sus operaciones y maximizar la eficiencia."

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:133
msgid "Field Research"
msgstr "Investigación de Campo"

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:135
msgid ""
"In-depth field research services to gather critical data and insights for "
"legal and business purposes."
msgstr ""
"Servicios de investigación de campo en profundidad para recopilar datos y "
"conocimientos críticos con fines legales y comerciales."

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:147
msgid "Civil Law"
msgstr "Derecho Civil"

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:149
msgid ""
"Our experts specialize in civil law, offering assistance with contracts, "
"property disputes, and personal injury cases."
msgstr ""
"Nuestros expertos se especializan en derecho civil y ofrecen asistencia con "
"contratos, disputas de propiedad y casos de infracción de derechos "
"civiles generarales."

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:161
msgid "Criminal Law"
msgstr "Derecho Penal"

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:163
msgid ""
"We handle criminal law cases, ensuring effective defense strategies for our "
"clients."
msgstr ""
"Manejamos casos de derecho penal, asegurando estrategias de defensa "
"efectivas para nuestros clientes."

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:175
msgid "Family Law"
msgstr "Derecho de Familia"

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:177
msgid ""
"Our firm provides family law services including divorce, custody, and "
"alimony."
msgstr ""
"Nuestra firma brinda servicios de derecho familiar que incluyen divorcio, "
"custodia y pensión alimenticia."

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:189
#: templates/partials/footer.html:27
msgid "Labor Law"
msgstr "Derecho Laboral"

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:191
msgid ""
"We assist in labor law matters including employment contracts, workplace "
"disputes, and labor rights."
msgstr ""
"Ayudamos en asuntos de derecho laboral, incluidos contratos laborales, "
"conflictos laborales y derechos laborales."

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:200
#: templates/partials/footer.html:35
msgid "International Law"
msgstr "Derecho Internacional"

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:207
msgid "Paymaster Services"
msgstr "Paymaster Internacional"

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:209
msgid ""
"Specialized services to ensure smooth international financial transactions, "
"with full transparency and security."
msgstr ""
"Servicios especializados para gestionar los flujos de pago en transacciones "
"internacionales de alto valor, garantizando la seguridad y la transparencia."

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:223
msgid ""
"We provide services for emergency conciliations in international disputes, "
"ensuring swift conflict resolution."
msgstr ""
"Servicios especializados para manejar conciliaciones urgentes en disputas "
"internacionales, asegurando resoluciones rápidas y efectivas."

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:235
msgid "Risk Analysis"
msgstr "Análisis de riesgos"

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:237
msgid ""
"We provide detailed risk assessments to identify and mitigate potential "
"threats in international operations."
msgstr ""
"Evaluaciones de riesgos integrales para transacciones internacionales, que "
"abarcan factores financieros, regulatorios y operativos."

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:249
msgid "Commercial Law"
msgstr "Derecho Comercial"

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:251
msgid ""
"We provide legal services in international commercial law, including "
"contract negotiation and dispute resolution."
msgstr ""
"Brindamos servicios legales en derecho comercial internacional, incluida la "
"negociación de contratos y la resolución de disputas."

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:263
msgid "Asset Management"
msgstr "Gestión de Activos"

#: templates/pages/sections/8_services_section.html:265
msgid ""
"We offer services in managing and optimizing international assets, ensuring "
"security and profitability."
msgstr ""
"Ofrecemos servicios de gestión y optimización de activos internacionales de "
"alto valor, garantizando la seguridad y la transparencia."

#: templates/pages/sections/9_gold.html:6
msgid "Official Mineral Trading Company"
msgstr "Empresa de Comercialización Oficial de Minerales"

#: templates/pages/sections/9_gold.html:19
msgid ""
"Institutional structure specializing in the national and international "
"marketing of precious metals, with reach in the United States, Canada, "
"Europe and South Africa."
msgstr ""
"Estructura institucional especializada en la comercialización nacional e "
"internacional de metales preciosos, con alcance en Estados Unidos, Canadá, "
"Europa y Sudáfrica."

#: templates/pages/sections/9_gold.html:20
msgid ""
"Through Propensiones S.A.S., comprehensive processes of purchase, sale, "
"transformation, benefit, intermediation and export of minerals such as gold,"
" silver, diamonds and emeralds are developed, under criteria of legality, "
"traceability and compliance with international regulations throughout the "
"value chain."
msgstr ""
"A través de Propensiones S.A.S., se desarrollan procesos integrales de "
"compra, venta, transformación, beneficio, intermediación y exportación de "
"minerales como oro, plata, diamantes y esmeraldas, bajo criterios de "
"legalidad, trazabilidad y cumplimiento normativo internacional en toda la "
"cadena de valor."

#: templates/pages/sections/alliance_section.html:8
msgid "International Private Consortium with a global purpose"
msgstr "Consorcio Privado Internacional con propósito global."

#: templates/pages/sections/alliance_section.html:9
