msgstr "Un Mismo Propósito Global"

#: templates/pages/sections/alliance_section.html:10
msgid ""
"We are proud to announce that we have consolidated our direct and active "
"presence in the North American market"
msgstr ""
"Nos enorgullece anunciar que hemos consolidado nuestra presencia directa y "
"activa en el mercado norteamericano."

#: templates/pages/sections/alliance_section.html:17
msgid "Global Alliance"
msgstr "Alianza Global"

