msgid "Propensiones Group"
msgstr "Grupo Propensiones"

#: templates/pages/sections/alliance_section.html:25
msgid ""
"A dynamic and interactive collaborative environment to generate efficiency, "
"innovation and shared competitive advantage."
msgstr ""
"Un entorno de colaboración dinámico e interactivo para generar eficiencia, "
"innovación y una ventaja competitiva compartida."

#: templates/pages/sections/alliance_section.html:33
#: templates/pages/sections/alliance_section.html:35
msgid "Propensiones Group Alliance"
msgstr "Alianza del Grupo Propensiones"

#: templates/pages/sections/alliance_section.html:43
#: templates/pages/sections/alliance_section.html:49
msgid "Covenant of Hope"
msgstr "Convenio de la Esperanza"

#: templates/pages/sections/onu_section.html:14
msgid ""
"The law firm Propensiones Internacional supports the <a "
"href=\"https://fundacionattlas.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener "
"noreferrer\" class=\"text-decoration-underline\">Fundación Attlas Org</a>, "
"REGISTERED in the database of the United Nations Department of Economic and "
"Social Affairs (UN DESA - ONU), within the framework of its project "
"‘Colombia Debt Relief: A New Beginning’."
msgstr ""
"La firma de abogados Propensiones Internacional respalda a la <a "
"href=\"https://fundacionattlas.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"opener "
"referrer\" class=\"text-decoration-underline\">Fundación Attlas Org</a>, "
"INSCRITA en la base de datos de United Nations Department of Economic and "
"Social Affairs (UN DESA - ONU), en el marco de su proyecto ‘Alivio de Deuda "
"Colombia: Un Nuevo Comienzo’."

#: templates/pages/sections/onu_section.html:24
msgid ""
"\n"
"                    This initiative seeks to strengthen asset recovery and economic stability through legal and\n"
"                    financial\n"
"                    mechanisms, promoting international cooperation and sustainable development. Its purpose is to\n"
"                    combat extreme\n"
"                    poverty and economic vulnerability by providing legal tools for financial rehabilitation, access to\n"
"                    decent\n"
"                    opportunities, and the construction of a fair and sustainable social balance.\n"
"                    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Esta iniciativa busca fortalecer la recuperación patrimonial y la estabilidad económica mediante mecanismos jurídicos y financieros, fomentando la cooperación internacional y el desarrollo sostenible. Su propósito es combatir la pobreza extrema y la vulnerabilidad económica, brindando herramientas legales para la rehabilitación financiera, el acceso a oportunidades dignas y la construcción de un equilibrio social justo y sostenible."

